    "created_at": "2023-07-12T04:50:12Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-07-12T04:50:12Z",
    "body": "`nonce` is actually a global content attribute: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#global-attributes:attr-nonce . It's a bit strange, and maybe as an editorial matter we could move it to just script and link?",
