    "created_at": "2023-08-18T08:53:52Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-08-18T08:53:52Z",
    "body": "Yeah, I think it was an oversight. You want the processing model to be global in case you introduce more elements that need nonces in the future, but conformance can still be done on a per-element basis. I'd be supportive of tightening this.\r\n\r\ncc @mikewest @arturjanc @sideshowbarker ",
